title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: ClamAV Database
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the age of each ClamAV virus signature database (main,
 daily, bytecode, ...) via {/nodes/{node}/clamav/database}. The build
 timestamp reported by ClamAV is compared against configurable
 WARN/CRIT age thresholds (default: 2 days / 7 days) -- an aging
 database usually means {clamav-freshclam} has stopped updating
 (network issue, broken mirror, disk full).

item:
 The database type, e.g. {main}, {daily}, {bytecode}.

discovery:
 One service per database type reported by the API is created.
